input: Add salami touchscreen and hall sensor drivers

From: ynk <evils.ynk@gmail.com>

Add the Synaptics TouchComm I2C touchscreen driver and IST8801 hall sensor driver, with their bindings and MAINTAINERS entries.

Signed-off-by: ynk <evils.ynk@gmail.com>
